flickos-style-experience (1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Experience, a bright style and its layout (ricing ADR-018): deep
    blue title bars with glossy rounded buttons and a red close,
    Greybird windows with the Tango icons, one blue panel at the bottom
    with a green Start button, the window list and a lighter
    notification area, a black console, pale yellow notifications, a
    green hill under a blue sky.
  * Homepage is flickos.org, and debian/copyright's Source the public
    repository.

